E2E: SDD

Purpose:
  End-to-End testing — verify complete user/business flows work across
  the entire system. E2E tests validate the system from the user's
  perspective, including all integrated components.

Owns: ./

Scope:
  Complete user workflows
  Multi-step business processes
  Cross-component interactions
  Real databases and services
  Production-like environment

Principles:
  Test real user journeys, not technical paths
  Use production-like data and configuration
  Keep E2E suite small and focused on critical paths
  E2E tests are slow — use them sparingly
  E2E failures require immediate investigation

Structure:
  Every E2E test MUST:
    represent a real user journey
    include all steps from start to finish
    verify business outcomes, not UI details
    clean up after itself

Frameworks:
  Playwright
  Cypress
  Selenium
  Detox (mobile E2E)
  Appium (mobile)

Navigation:
  Project: @project/project.sdd
  Workflow: @workflow/testing.sdd
  TestLevels: @levels.sdd
  TestTypes: @types.sdd
  TestGates: @gates.sdd
  BDD: @bdd.sdd
  Unit: @unit.sdd
  Integration: @integration.sdd
  API: @api.sdd
  UI: @ui.sdd
  Mobile: @mobile.sdd
